{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"hooks\":[{\"schema_version\":\"marketing.hook.v1\",\"id\":\"hook.tiktok.7469941064267304210.001\",\"text\":\"気分が重い場所から抜け出せないときは、考え方より先に“明るい刺激”を入れる。心の空気を変える小さなリセット習慣。\",\"language\":\"ja\",\"product_ids\":[\"ebook-ja\"],\"source_type\":\"video\",\"source_url\":\"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7469941064267304210\",\"source_null_reason\":null,\"captured_at\":\"2026-08-02T02:43:53.609377Z\",\"provenance\":\"live_observed\",\"rubric\":{\"hook\":8,\"emotional_peak\":8,\"conflict\":7,\"quotability\":8,\"practical_value\":8,\"total\":39},\"status\":\"active\",\"ewma_score\":null,\"observations\":0,\"evidence_url\":\"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7469941064267304210\",\"evidence_null_reason\":null},{\"schema_version\":\"marketing.hook.v1\",\"id\":\"hook.tiktok.7469941064267304210.002\",\"text\":\"誰かの不機嫌を受け取ってしまった日は、無理に前向きにならなくていい。五感を使って、自分の気分を自分の場所へ戻す方法があります。\",\"language\":\"ja\",\"product_ids\":[\"ebook-ja\"],\"source_type\":\"video\",\"source_url\":\"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7469941064267304210\",\"source_null_reason\":null,\"captured_at\":\"2026-08-02T02:43:53.609377Z\",\"provenance\":\"live_observed\",\"rubric\":{\"hook\":8,\"emotional_peak\":9,\"conflict\":8,\"quotability\":8,\"practical_value\":9,\"total\":42},\"status\":\"active\",\"ewma_score\":null,\"observations\":0,\"evidence_url\":\"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7469941064267304210\",\"evidence_null_reason\":null},{\"schema_version\":\"marketing.hook.v1\",\"id\":\"hook.tiktok.7469941064267304210.003\",\"text\":\"嫌な空気に飲まれたまま帰宅しないために。部屋に入った瞬間、自分の心を切り替える三分間の儀式を決めておこう。\",\"language\":\"ja\",\"product_ids\":[\"ebook-ja\"],\"source_type\":\"video\",\"source_url\":\"https://www.tiktok.com/@furutani_kodai/video/7469941064267304210\",\"source_null_reason\":null,\"captured_at\":\"2026-08-02T02:43:53.609377Z\",\"provenance\":\"live_observed\",\"rubric\":{\"hook\":9,\"emotional_pe